From AOSP 12 (android-12.1.0_r1) frameworks/base/cmds/screencap/screencap.cpp.
Apply with `git apply` in the platform tree, then `m screencap` and copy
out/target/product/generic_arm64/system/bin/screencap to vendor/screencap-secure-arm64.
-a captures FLAG_SECURE layers (needs uid 0 or CAPTURE_BLACKOUT_CONTENT);
-w/-H set the capture buffer size.

